source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: The pair breaks the line and the asterisk behind it closes nothing, so Jira renders no bold; jiro keeps both asterisks as text and reads the hard break.
-- input.jira --
*ab\\*
-- rendered.html --
<p>*ab<br class="atl-forced-newline" />*</p>
-- want.md --
\*ab\
\*
-- warnings.json --
[]
